---
code: field.name.uncapitalize
description: Lowercase the first letter of every exported field name (Barcode -> barcode)
default-enabled: false
---

# Generated models often declare `public String Barcode` alongside `getBarcode()`.
# Normalizing both to `barcode` lets the model builder keep one property (#1492).
field.name=groovy:```
    return tool.uncapitalize(it.fieldName())
```
